  "duration_s": 518.344828,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "上一集我们讲了，王成书被美国扣留七年，硬是把九百公斤资料蚂蚁搬家寄回国。一九五六年终于踏上祖国的土地。很多人问，回来之后呢，她到底干了什么？能让毛主席亲口叫她女功臣。今天这集我给你算清一笔账，有个女人这辈子在关键时刻只说过三个字，我愿意。有这仨字字他说了三回，第一回扔掉了研究二十年的看家本领，第二回把名字从全世界抹掉了，第三回把余生也埋了进去，连丈夫都不能说他在哪到去世那天，全国没几个人知道他叫啥，而他本来是能拿诺贝尔奖的，他叫王成书。今天我把这三回，我愿意，一单一单给你算清楚。嗯，每当他赔进去，什么国家又赢回了什么第一回，我愿意。一九五八年，他已经四十六岁二十年积累的锡箔气体研究说清零就清零。一九五六年回国后王成书，本来可以接着搞他的锡薄气体，那是他搞了二十年，已经站在世界顶端的领域，WCU方程就是他的名片。可才过了两年，钱三强上门找他谈合作，国家要建热核聚变研究室，国内这方面一片空白。你来带头，你知道这意味着什么吗？他搞的是高空稀薄气体，那是天上飘的东西。热何聚变是地上的工程，物理听着都叫物理，实际上完全是两码事。更要命的是，他已经四十六岁了，专业早就定型了。这是让他把过去研究了二十年的心血，一笔勾销，回去当小学生重新改研究方向，前三强，还在等他犹豫，他张嘴就来，我愿意接下来发生的事儿，只能用恐怖来形容。他从四十六岁开始自学俄语，被派去苏联库尔恰托夫研究所进修，从莫斯科回到北京，坐了七天七夜的火车。别人在睡觉，他趴在小桌板上，把美国核聚变规划的机密文献学武德方案给翻译。完了两年。就这两年，他带出一支队伍，把国内热核聚变理论的空白给填上了，直接成了中国受控核聚变和等离子体物理的开创者。四十六岁归零，四十八岁又重新登顶单。这一项他培进去二十年的专业知识的积累，国家迎回了一个从零到一的新领域。第二回，我愿意。一九六一年那年，他四十九岁，连人带名字一起销毁，刚要出大成果。第二单来了。一九六一年，苏联专家卷着图纸全跑了，原子弹的命门，核燃料浓缩又卡死了。天然釉里能裂变的又两百三十五，只有百分之零点七，要造原子弹又又得浓缩到百分之九十以上。这活儿全中国压根儿就没人会钱三强，第三次坐到他对面和他谈。这次我把丑话说，在前面，这事儿要绝对保密，不能发论文，也不能参加。学术会议，你的去向，连你丈夫都不能说。你要是接了这项羽，从今往后物理学家王成书就等于没了，年近半百，第二次从零开始，还要把名字从这世界上抹去，他又是那仨字，我愿意。事后他自己说过一句话，我建议你记住谁干都不容易。何况回国前我就下了决心，一定服从祖国的需要，哪怕从零开始。一九六二年，她悄悄离开北京，去了甘肃兰州的武陵寺厂。中国第一座幼童未素分离工厂，丈夫在外地承担国家任务，儿子一个人在北京念寄宿学校，一家三口天各一方。一别就是好几年。武陵四厂那么多科研人员。她是这里面唯一的女性条件苦到什么程度，全索就一台每秒十五万次的电子计算机。白天大家排队用，她就专挑后半夜和节假日去抢机时。手摇计算机计算尺几十箱计算纸条，它一张一张过目验算，别人算出，结果她还不满意，非要你说清楚，物理意义，硬生生把一头黑发算成了白雪。他提出了一个方案，分九批启动第五批即取料，直接把投产周期提前了一百一十三天。一九六二年领导来视察，问他能不能按时完成。他说了一句，后来扎进无数人心窝子的话。在我的字典里，除了对孩子的承诺没有兑现对国家的要求，我全能兑现，对得起四万万孩子就对不起自己。那一个。一九六四年一月十四日，第一批风度百分之九十以上的合格核燃料下限，中国成了世界上第五个掌握这项技术的国家。同年十月十六日，罗布泊内一声巨响，聂荣臻向毛主席报告成功的消息。毛主席说，这是中国第一颗原子弹爆炸的女功臣，可他连上节欢庆的资格都没有。这一单，他赔进去的名字，家庭名誉国家赢回了原子弹的心脏第三回，我愿意。一九六四年之后，他把余生也交了出去，原子弹响了，他本可以功成身退名字也可以公开了吧。没有组织找到他，国家还有项目，要他继续干，你的身份还得藏着。问他这儿有什么困难，没有，生活上有困难，没有，有话要带给丈夫孩子吗？没有，那让你继续留下搞研究，愿意吗？我愿意。这一留就从一九六四年留到了一九七七年才调回北京。一九八零年，他当选中科院学部委员。可普通老百姓压根就没没听过这名字。现在这这回合合起来看一个本可以去领诺贝尔奖的女人，用一辈子说了三次，我愿意换来中国热核巨变零的突破。何然料提前一百一十三天以及一条自己从头走到底的沉默之路，她有权不会用有钱，不会花有福，不会享。这话说他是骂人的话里最重的夸耀。王成书，三次说我愿意的故事就写在国之脊梁。这本书里，书里还有四十多位，像他这样，国家医生召唤就毫不犹豫说我愿意的人，每一位的选择都比小说还震撼。有兴趣的朋友左下角链接直接带走下一集。我们换个角度，在全是男人的核武研制团队里，她是唯一的女人。这个女人用一辈子打了三次脸，点赞、收藏，把这条转给身边更多的人关注我，咱们下一集接着讲。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 1490,
      "text": "上一集我们讲了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1490,
      "end_ms": 3810,
      "text": "王成书被美国扣留七年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00003",
      "start_ms": 4330,
      "end_ms": 7990,
      "text": "硬是把九百公斤资料蚂蚁搬家寄回国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00004",
      "start_ms": 8530,
      "end_ms": 11530,
      "text": "一九五六年终于踏上祖国的土地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00005",
      "start_ms": 12130,
      "end_ms": 12910,
      "text": "很多人问，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00006",
      "start_ms": 13530,
      "end_ms": 14530,
      "text": "回来之后呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00007",
      "start_ms": 14630,
      "end_ms": 16070,
      "text": "她到底干了什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00008",
      "start_ms": 16410,
      "end_ms": 19190,
      "text": "能让毛主席亲口叫她女功臣。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00009",
      "start_ms": 19730,
      "end_ms": 22410,
      "text": "今天这集我给你算清一笔账，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00010",
      "start_ms": 23870,
      "end_ms": 28250,
      "text": "有个女人这辈子在关键时刻只说过三个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00011",
      "start_ms": 28250,
      "end_ms": 28890,
      "text": "我愿意。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00012",
      "start_ms": 29310,
      "end_ms": 31480,
      "text": "有这仨字字他说了三回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00013",
      "start_ms": 32380,
      "end_ms": 36460,
      "text": "第一回扔掉了研究二十年的看家本领，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00014",
      "start_ms": 36460,
      "end_ms": 39620,
      "text": "第二回把名字从全世界抹掉了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00015",
      "start_ms": 40420,
      "end_ms": 43100,
      "text": "第三回把余生也埋了进去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00016",
      "start_ms": 43740,
      "end_ms": 47700,
      "text": "连丈夫都不能说他在哪到去世那天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00017",
      "start_ms": 48000,
      "end_ms": 49980,
      "text": "全国没几个人知道他叫啥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00018",
      "start_ms": 50400,
      "end_ms": 53500,
      "text": "而他本来是能拿诺贝尔奖的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00019",
      "start_ms": 54080,
      "end_ms": 55240,
      "text": "他叫王成书。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00020",
      "start_ms": 55820,
      "end_ms": 56980,
      "text": "今天我把这三回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00021",
      "start_ms": 57000,
      "end_ms": 57580,
      "text": "我愿意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00022",
      "start_ms": 58060,
      "end_ms": 59945,
      "text": "一单一单给你算清楚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00023",
      "start_ms": 60130,
      "end_ms": 60370,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00024",
      "start_ms": 60680,
      "end_ms": 62000,
      "text": "每当他赔进去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00025",
      "start_ms": 62000,
      "end_ms": 65345,
      "text": "什么国家又赢回了什么第一回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00026",
      "start_ms": 67460,
      "end_ms": 68155,
      "text": "我愿意。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00027",
      "start_ms": 70620,
      "end_ms": 71515,
      "text": "一九五八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00028",
      "start_ms": 71930,
      "end_ms": 79045,
      "text": "他已经四十六岁二十年积累的锡箔气体研究说清零就清零。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00029",
      "start_ms": 79350,
      "end_ms": 81830,
      "text": "一九五六年回国后王成书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00030",
      "start_ms": 81850,
      "end_ms": 84345,
      "text": "本来可以接着搞他的锡薄气体，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00031",
      "start_ms": 84900,
      "end_ms": 86325,
      "text": "那是他搞了二十年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00032",
      "start_ms": 86860,
      "end_ms": 89235,
      "text": "已经站在世界顶端的领域，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00033",
      "start_ms": 89690,
      "end_ms": 91955,
      "text": "WCU方程就是他的名片。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00034",
      "start_ms": 92530,
      "end_ms": 93605,
      "text": "可才过了两年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00035",
      "start_ms": 94050,
      "end_ms": 96145,
      "text": "钱三强上门找他谈合作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00036",
      "start_ms": 96510,
      "end_ms": 98965,
      "text": "国家要建热核聚变研究室，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00037",
      "start_ms": 99780,
      "end_ms": 101685,
      "text": "国内这方面一片空白。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00038",
      "start_ms": 101960,
      "end_ms": 102625,
      "text": "你来带头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00039",
      "start_ms": 103960,
      "end_ms": 105545,
      "text": "你知道这意味着什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00040",
      "start_ms": 106040,
      "end_ms": 108445,
      "text": "他搞的是高空稀薄气体，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00041",
      "start_ms": 109010,
      "end_ms": 110545,
      "text": "那是天上飘的东西。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00042",
      "start_ms": 110980,
      "end_ms": 113160,
      "text": "热何聚变是地上的工程，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00043",
      "start_ms": 113240,
      "end_ms": 114705,
      "text": "物理听着都叫物理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00044",
      "start_ms": 115030,
      "end_ms": 116715,
      "text": "实际上完全是两码事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00045",
      "start_ms": 117510,
      "end_ms": 118495,
      "text": "更要命的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00046",
      "start_ms": 118790,
      "end_ms": 120225,
      "text": "他已经四十六岁了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00047",
      "start_ms": 121390,
      "end_ms": 123025,
      "text": "专业早就定型了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00048",
      "start_ms": 123790,
      "end_ms": 126570,
      "text": "这是让他把过去研究了二十年的心血，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00049",
      "start_ms": 126610,
      "end_ms": 127554,
      "text": "一笔勾销，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00050",
      "start_ms": 128140,
      "end_ms": 131035,
      "text": "回去当小学生重新改研究方向，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00051",
      "start_ms": 131600,
      "end_ms": 132300,
      "text": "前三强，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00052",
      "start_ms": 132360,
      "end_ms": 133815,
      "text": "还在等他犹豫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00053",
      "start_ms": 134180,
      "end_ms": 135225,
      "text": "他张嘴就来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00054",
      "start_ms": 135580,
      "end_ms": 138555,
      "text": "我愿意接下来发生的事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00055",
      "start_ms": 138850,
      "end_ms": 140845,
      "text": "只能用恐怖来形容。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00056",
      "start_ms": 141680,
      "end_ms": 144415,
      "text": "他从四十六岁开始自学俄语，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00057",
      "start_ms": 144810,
      "end_ms": 148495,
      "text": "被派去苏联库尔恰托夫研究所进修，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00058",
      "start_ms": 149270,
      "end_ms": 150810,
      "text": "从莫斯科回到北京，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00059",
      "start_ms": 150910,
      "end_ms": 152925,
      "text": "坐了七天七夜的火车。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00060",
      "start_ms": 153850,
      "end_ms": 155095,
      "text": "别人在睡觉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00061",
      "start_ms": 155820,
      "end_ms": 157485,
      "text": "他趴在小桌板上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00062",
      "start_ms": 158210,
      "end_ms": 163380,
      "text": "把美国核聚变规划的机密文献学武德方案给翻译。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00063",
      "start_ms": 163380,
      "end_ms": 165055,
      "text": "完了两年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00064",
      "start_ms": 167150,
      "end_ms": 167875,
      "text": "就这两年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00065",
      "start_ms": 168430,
      "end_ms": 169555,
      "text": "他带出一支队伍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00066",
      "start_ms": 170580,
      "end_ms": 174695,
      "text": "把国内热核聚变理论的空白给填上了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00067",
      "start_ms": 175450,
      "end_ms": 180205,
      "text": "直接成了中国受控核聚变和等离子体物理的开创者。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00068",
      "start_ms": 181360,
      "end_ms": 182615,
      "text": "四十六岁归零，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00069",
      "start_ms": 183140,
      "end_ms": 186400,
      "text": "四十八岁又重新登顶单。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00070",
      "start_ms": 186400,
      "end_ms": 191215,
      "text": "这一项他培进去二十年的专业知识的积累，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00071",
      "start_ms": 191520,
      "end_ms": 194355,
      "text": "国家迎回了一个从零到一的新领域。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00072",
      "start_ms": 194530,
      "end_ms": 194970,
      "text": "第二回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00073",
      "start_ms": 194970,
      "end_ms": 195575,
      "text": "我愿意。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00074",
      "start_ms": 196780,
      "end_ms": 197980,
      "text": "一九六一年那年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00075",
      "start_ms": 197980,
      "end_ms": 199005,
      "text": "他四十九岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00076",
      "start_ms": 199460,
      "end_ms": 201425,
      "text": "连人带名字一起销毁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00077",
      "start_ms": 201820,
      "end_ms": 203155,
      "text": "刚要出大成果。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00078",
      "start_ms": 203490,
      "end_ms": 204305,
      "text": "第二单来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00079",
      "start_ms": 205900,
      "end_ms": 206905,
      "text": "一九六一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00080",
      "start_ms": 207270,
      "end_ms": 209935,
      "text": "苏联专家卷着图纸全跑了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00081",
      "start_ms": 210400,
      "end_ms": 211620,
      "text": "原子弹的命门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00082",
      "start_ms": 211900,
      "end_ms": 214865,
      "text": "核燃料浓缩又卡死了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00083",
      "start_ms": 215230,
      "end_ms": 218730,
      "text": "天然釉里能裂变的又两百三十五，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00084",
      "start_ms": 218730,
      "end_ms": 220015,
      "text": "只有百分之零点七，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00085",
      "start_ms": 220640,
      "end_ms": 224140,
      "text": "要造原子弹又又得浓缩到百分之九十以上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00086",
      "start_ms": 224240,
      "end_ms": 229500,
      "text": "这活儿全中国压根儿就没人会钱三强，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00087",
      "start_ms": 229600,
      "end_ms": 231925,
      "text": "第三次坐到他对面和他谈。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00088",
      "start_ms": 232870,
      "end_ms": 234310,
      "text": "这次我把丑话说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00089",
      "start_ms": 234310,
      "end_ms": 234915,
      "text": "在前面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00090",
      "start_ms": 235830,
      "end_ms": 237315,
      "text": "这事儿要绝对保密，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00091",
      "start_ms": 238790,
      "end_ms": 239575,
      "text": "不能发论文，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00092",
      "start_ms": 240390,
      "end_ms": 241330,
      "text": "也不能参加。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00093",
      "start_ms": 241330,
      "end_ms": 242070,
      "text": "学术会议，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00094",
      "start_ms": 242550,
      "end_ms": 243390,
      "text": "你的去向，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00095",
      "start_ms": 243410,
      "end_ms": 244650,
      "text": "连你丈夫都不能说。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00096",
      "start_ms": 245130,
      "end_ms": 246690,
      "text": "你要是接了这项羽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00097",
      "start_ms": 246950,
      "end_ms": 251110,
      "text": "从今往后物理学家王成书就等于没了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00098",
      "start_ms": 252830,
      "end_ms": 253870,
      "text": "年近半百，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00099",
      "start_ms": 254350,
      "end_ms": 255910,
      "text": "第二次从零开始，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00100",
      "start_ms": 256190,
      "end_ms": 258350,
      "text": "还要把名字从这世界上抹去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00101",
      "start_ms": 258710,
      "end_ms": 259970,
      "text": "他又是那仨字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00102",
      "start_ms": 260150,
      "end_ms": 260810,
      "text": "我愿意。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00103",
      "start_ms": 261510,
      "end_ms": 263070,
      "text": "事后他自己说过一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00104",
      "start_ms": 263130,
      "end_ms": 265710,
      "text": "我建议你记住谁干都不容易。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00105",
      "start_ms": 266530,
      "end_ms": 268650,
      "text": "何况回国前我就下了决心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00106",
      "start_ms": 269430,
      "end_ms": 271420,
      "text": "一定服从祖国的需要，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00107",
      "start_ms": 272100,
      "end_ms": 273400,
      "text": "哪怕从零开始。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00108",
      "start_ms": 274500,
      "end_ms": 275500,
      "text": "一九六二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00109",
      "start_ms": 275500,
      "end_ms": 276760,
      "text": "她悄悄离开北京，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00110",
      "start_ms": 277280,
      "end_ms": 279740,
      "text": "去了甘肃兰州的武陵寺厂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00111",
      "start_ms": 279920,
      "end_ms": 283460,
      "text": "中国第一座幼童未素分离工厂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00112",
      "start_ms": 284260,
      "end_ms": 286620,
      "text": "丈夫在外地承担国家任务，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00113",
      "start_ms": 286860,
      "end_ms": 289800,
      "text": "儿子一个人在北京念寄宿学校，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00114",
      "start_ms": 290240,
      "end_ms": 292360,
      "text": "一家三口天各一方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00115",
      "start_ms": 292740,
      "end_ms": 294580,
      "text": "一别就是好几年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00116",
      "start_ms": 295840,
      "end_ms": 298595,
      "text": "武陵四厂那么多科研人员。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00117",
      "start_ms": 299240,
      "end_ms": 302900,
      "text": "她是这里面唯一的女性条件苦到什么程度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00118",
      "start_ms": 303140,
      "end_ms": 306720,
      "text": "全索就一台每秒十五万次的电子计算机。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00119",
      "start_ms": 307580,
      "end_ms": 309000,
      "text": "白天大家排队用，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00120",
      "start_ms": 309180,
      "end_ms": 312760,
      "text": "她就专挑后半夜和节假日去抢机时。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00121",
      "start_ms": 313100,
      "end_ms": 318640,
      "text": "手摇计算机计算尺几十箱计算纸条，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00122",
      "start_ms": 319420,
      "end_ms": 322100,
      "text": "它一张一张过目验算，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00123",
      "start_ms": 323020,
      "end_ms": 323980,
      "text": "别人算出，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00124",
      "start_ms": 323980,
      "end_ms": 325280,
      "text": "结果她还不满意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00125",
      "start_ms": 326080,
      "end_ms": 327500,
      "text": "非要你说清楚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00126",
      "start_ms": 327540,
      "end_ms": 328575,
      "text": "物理意义，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00127",
      "start_ms": 329800,
      "end_ms": 333520,
      "text": "硬生生把一头黑发算成了白雪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00128",
      "start_ms": 333900,
      "end_ms": 335140,
      "text": "他提出了一个方案，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00129",
      "start_ms": 335380,
      "end_ms": 338840,
      "text": "分九批启动第五批即取料，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00130",
      "start_ms": 339140,
      "end_ms": 342200,
      "text": "直接把投产周期提前了一百一十三天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00131",
      "start_ms": 342440,
      "end_ms": 344940,
      "text": "一九六二年领导来视察，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00132",
      "start_ms": 345260,
      "end_ms": 348120,
      "text": "问他能不能按时完成。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00133",
      "start_ms": 349060,
      "end_ms": 349880,
      "text": "他说了一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00134",
      "start_ms": 349880,
      "end_ms": 352420,
      "text": "后来扎进无数人心窝子的话。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00135",
      "start_ms": 353260,
      "end_ms": 354400,
      "text": "在我的字典里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00136",
      "start_ms": 354820,
      "end_ms": 359375,
      "text": "除了对孩子的承诺没有兑现对国家的要求，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00137",
      "start_ms": 359910,
      "end_ms": 361095,
      "text": "我全能兑现，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00138",
      "start_ms": 362020,
      "end_ms": 364800,
      "text": "对得起四万万孩子就对不起自己。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00139",
      "start_ms": 364800,
      "end_ms": 365455,
      "text": "那一个。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00140",
      "start_ms": 366140,
      "end_ms": 368125,
      "text": "一九六四年一月十四日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00141",
      "start_ms": 368500,
      "end_ms": 372965,
      "text": "第一批风度百分之九十以上的合格核燃料下限，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00142",
      "start_ms": 373600,
      "end_ms": 377555,
      "text": "中国成了世界上第五个掌握这项技术的国家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00143",
      "start_ms": 378210,
      "end_ms": 379870,
      "text": "同年十月十六日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00144",
      "start_ms": 379930,
      "end_ms": 381745,
      "text": "罗布泊内一声巨响，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00145",
      "start_ms": 382210,
      "end_ms": 385255,
      "text": "聂荣臻向毛主席报告成功的消息。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00146",
      "start_ms": 385540,
      "end_ms": 386385,
      "text": "毛主席说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00147",
      "start_ms": 386740,
      "end_ms": 390735,
      "text": "这是中国第一颗原子弹爆炸的女功臣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00148",
      "start_ms": 391370,
      "end_ms": 393765,
      "text": "可他连上节欢庆的资格都没有。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00149",
      "start_ms": 394380,
      "end_ms": 394965,
      "text": "这一单，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00150",
      "start_ms": 395250,
      "end_ms": 396605,
      "text": "他赔进去的名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00151",
      "start_ms": 396940,
      "end_ms": 402195,
      "text": "家庭名誉国家赢回了原子弹的心脏第三回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00152",
      "start_ms": 402490,
      "end_ms": 403175,
      "text": "我愿意。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00153",
      "start_ms": 403530,
      "end_ms": 404915,
      "text": "一九六四年之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00154",
      "start_ms": 405230,
      "end_ms": 406955,
      "text": "他把余生也交了出去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00155",
      "start_ms": 407460,
      "end_ms": 408485,
      "text": "原子弹响了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00156",
      "start_ms": 408810,
      "end_ms": 412125,
      "text": "他本可以功成身退名字也可以公开了吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00157",
      "start_ms": 414240,
      "end_ms": 415885,
      "text": "没有组织找到他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00158",
      "start_ms": 416270,
      "end_ms": 417510,
      "text": "国家还有项目，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00159",
      "start_ms": 417510,
      "end_ms": 418475,
      "text": "要他继续干，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00160",
      "start_ms": 419140,
      "end_ms": 420800,
      "text": "你的身份还得藏着。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00161",
      "start_ms": 421220,
      "end_ms": 423740,
      "text": "问他这儿有什么困难，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00162",
      "start_ms": 424460,
      "end_ms": 424940,
      "text": "没有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00163",
      "start_ms": 425900,
      "end_ms": 427340,
      "text": "生活上有困难，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00164",
      "start_ms": 427340,
      "end_ms": 427740,
      "text": "没有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00165",
      "start_ms": 428060,
      "end_ms": 430320,
      "text": "有话要带给丈夫孩子吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00166",
      "start_ms": 430640,
      "end_ms": 431160,
      "text": "没有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00167",
      "start_ms": 432300,
      "end_ms": 434140,
      "text": "那让你继续留下搞研究，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00168",
      "start_ms": 434440,
      "end_ms": 435100,
      "text": "愿意吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00169",
      "start_ms": 436500,
      "end_ms": 437320,
      "text": "我愿意。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00170",
      "start_ms": 438240,
      "end_ms": 444440,
      "text": "这一留就从一九六四年留到了一九七七年才调回北京。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00171",
      "start_ms": 445580,
      "end_ms": 446720,
      "text": "一九八零年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00172",
      "start_ms": 446860,
      "end_ms": 449370,
      "text": "他当选中科院学部委员。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00173",
      "start_ms": 449930,
      "end_ms": 453810,
      "text": "可普通老百姓压根就没没听过这名字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00174",
      "start_ms": 453850,
      "end_ms": 458430,
      "text": "现在这这回合合起来看一个本可以去领诺贝尔奖的女人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00175",
      "start_ms": 458510,
      "end_ms": 460270,
      "text": "用一辈子说了三次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00176",
      "start_ms": 460270,
      "end_ms": 463890,
      "text": "我愿意换来中国热核巨变零的突破。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00177",
      "start_ms": 464290,
      "end_ms": 470810,
      "text": "何然料提前一百一十三天以及一条自己从头走到底的沉默之路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00178",
      "start_ms": 471430,
      "end_ms": 473670,
      "text": "她有权不会用有钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00179",
      "start_ms": 473710,
      "end_ms": 475170,
      "text": "不会花有福，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00180",
      "start_ms": 475250,
      "end_ms": 475770,
      "text": "不会享。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00181",
      "start_ms": 476630,
      "end_ms": 480815,
      "text": "这话说他是骂人的话里最重的夸耀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00182",
      "start_ms": 481300,
      "end_ms": 481960,
      "text": "王成书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00183",
      "start_ms": 481960,
      "end_ms": 486220,
      "text": "三次说我愿意的故事就写在国之脊梁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00184",
      "start_ms": 486220,
      "end_ms": 486985,
      "text": "这本书里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00185",
      "start_ms": 487960,
      "end_ms": 489220,
      "text": "书里还有四十多位，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00186",
      "start_ms": 489220,
      "end_ms": 489805,
      "text": "像他这样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00187",
      "start_ms": 490830,
      "end_ms": 493705,
      "text": "国家医生召唤就毫不犹豫说我愿意的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00188",
      "start_ms": 493970,
      "end_ms": 497115,
      "text": "每一位的选择都比小说还震撼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00189",
      "start_ms": 497610,
      "end_ms": 501545,
      "text": "有兴趣的朋友左下角链接直接带走下一集。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00190",
      "start_ms": 501900,
      "end_ms": 502845,
      "text": "我们换个角度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00191",
      "start_ms": 503270,
      "end_ms": 506125,
      "text": "在全是男人的核武研制团队里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00192",
      "start_ms": 506600,
      "end_ms": 507815,
      "text": "她是唯一的女人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00193",
      "start_ms": 508240,
      "end_ms": 510965,
      "text": "这个女人用一辈子打了三次脸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00194",
      "start_ms": 511300,
      "end_ms": 512605,
      "text": "点赞、收藏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00195",
      "start_ms": 513000,
      "end_ms": 516515,
      "text": "把这条转给身边更多的人关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bbc826285634ad42_s00196",
      "start_ms": 516760,
      "end_ms": 518235,
      "text": "咱们下一集接着讲。"
    }
  ],
